sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Collector
    participant UI as Web UI
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant O as Orchestrator
    participant T as Tools
    participant L as LLMClient (OpenRouter)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL + pgvector
    actor M as Finance Manager

    C->>UI: Ask "What should we do with ABC Trading?"
    UI->>API: POST /agent/run
    API->>API: Check role, tenant, assigned customer
    API->>O: run(customer, question, conversation)
    loop until the answer is ready
        O->>L: messages + tool schema
        L-->>O: tool call
        O->>T: execute (tenant-scoped, logged)
        T->>DB: read numbers, rules, passages, memory
        T-->>O: tool result (numbers come from code)
    end
    O->>L: tool results
    L-->>O: answer with reasons and citations
    O->>DB: save recommendation (pending), agent run
    O-->>API: recommendation
    API->>DB: audit entry
    API-->>UI: recommendation panel
    C->>UI: Generate a draft (choose a tone)
    UI->>API: POST /customers/{id}/drafts
    API->>T: draft + rule-based check
    T-->>API: Arabic draft, check result
    M->>UI: Edit one sentence, approve
    UI->>API: POST /collection/recommendations/{id}/approve
    API->>API: Check that this role may approve (flagged items need a manager)
    API->>DB: mark approved or edited, create the task, save the draft version, audit entry
    Note over API,DB: Task creation is rejected for any recommendation that is not approved
    API-->>UI: done (nothing was sent externally)
